/*
 * Declares the NameDelegateValue class.
 *
 * NameDelegateValue is a delegate generated from a name prototype(cf.
 * NamePrototypeValue), generally a lambda function, or a runtime function.
 * NamePrototypeValue not respecting naming convention of Ymir modules and
 * having a renaming to make sure they are either uniq, or declared outside a
 * Ymir package.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::delegate::name
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/delegate/name.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-07
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
